    <Section>entry</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2175</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00001e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレの氷とおまえの炎……
同じなのか……？
この力は一体……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Meu gelo e o seu fogo...
São a mesma coisa?
Que poder é esse...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2212</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00001f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おまえのその力は&lt;Red&gt;フォルス&lt;White&gt;という。
使い方を誤らなければ、この先、
おまえにとって大きな助けとなる。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>É um poder chamado &lt;Red&gt;Force&lt;White&gt;.
Se usado com sabedoria, será
um grande trunfo para você
daqui em diante.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2258</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000020</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>フォルス……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Force?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2301</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000021</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そう、フォルス。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>É, Force.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2469</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000022</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>これが、
そのフォルスの具現化したもの。
フォルスキューブさ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isto aqui é uma manifestação de
Force. Chama-se Force Cube.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2517</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000023</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ボクたちは旅をしている。
ボクやキミのような能力……
フォルスを持った仲間を探すために。
ボクたちの世界を救うために。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A gente tá numa jornada. Uma
jornada pra achar mais gente que
use Force como você e eu.
Uma jornada... pra salvar o mundo.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2649</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000024</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>すべてはフォルスによって
起こったコトなんだよ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tudo isso aconteceu por causa
do Force, sabe?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2686</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000025</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>フォルスは
生命と精神のパワーが生み出す
&lt;Cyan&gt;特殊能力&lt;White&gt;の事だ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Force é uma &lt;Cyan&gt;habilidade especial&lt;White&gt;
nascida da vida e do espírito.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2707</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000026</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>フォルスはもともと
俺のような&lt;Cyan&gt;ガジュマ&lt;White&gt;にしか
発現しないものだった。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Originalmente, só se manifestava
em &lt;Cyan&gt;Gajuma&lt;White&gt; como eu.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2736</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000027</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だったら、なぜ……
オレやそいつのような
&lt;Cyan&gt;ヒューマ&lt;White&gt;にそんな力が……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Se é assim, por que
&lt;Cyan&gt;Huma&lt;White&gt; como eu e ele
têm esses poderes?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2765</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000028</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ある時から、ヒューマの中にも
フォルス能力者が現れるように
なったんだよ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Depois de um certo incidente,
usuários de Force também
surgiram entre os Huma.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2794</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000029</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>今では、ガジュマやヒューマという
種族の区別なく、色々な種類の
フォルスを持った能力者がいるんだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Agora não importa se é Gajuma
ou Huma. Tem muitos usuários
de todos os tipos de Force.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2815</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00002a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>キミのフォルスは「氷」。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Seu Force é o do Gelo.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>You have the Force of Ice maybe</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2836</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00002b</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Yellow&gt;氷のフォルス&lt;White&gt;……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O &lt;Yellow&gt;Force do Gelo&lt;White&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2857</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00002c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>キミは、氷を自在に
操るコトができるでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Você consegue manipular
o gelo à vontade, né?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2893</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00002d</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>今はな……
だが、クレアの氷だけは
どうする事もできない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Agora consigo, mas... não consigo
fazer nada com o gelo que
envolve a Claire.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2914</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00002e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それはキミのフォルスが
暴走した時の氷だからだヨ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isso porque esse gelo é de quando
o seu Force saiu de controle.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2943</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00002f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>心の力であるフォルスは、
持つ者の心が不安定だと
過度に反応し、制御できなくなる。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sendo um poder que vem do
coração, o Force pode ficar
incontrolável se as emoções de
quem o possui ficarem instáveis.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2970</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000030</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>キミの力の覚醒は突然のコトだった。
準備ができていなかったキミの心は
力を制御できずに、彼女を……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Seu poder despertou em você
de repente. Sem preparo, seu
coração não aguentou, e ela...
bom...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>fixed Razor script remnant.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3015</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000031</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それがフォルスの暴走なんだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>É isso que acontece quando
o Force de alguém
sai de controle.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3058</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000032</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この氷は、今のおまえの能力では
消す事は不可能だ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Será impossível para alguém
com a sua habilidade atual
remover este gelo.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3087</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000033</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……どうすればクレアは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Então como posso ajudá-la?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3116</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000034</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここはボクに任せて、&lt;Veigue&gt;。
キミが&lt;Yellow&gt;氷&lt;White&gt;ならボクは&lt;Yellow&gt;炎&lt;White&gt;。
&lt;Yellow&gt;氷&lt;White&gt;を溶かすには……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Deixa comigo, &lt;Veigue&gt;. Você tem
Gelo, e eu tenho Fogo. Agora,
pra derreter gelo...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3184</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000035</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Yellow&gt;炎&lt;White&gt;を近づければいい。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...É preciso esquentar as coisas.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3223</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000036</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>フォルスの炎よ!!
氷の眠りから彼女を解き放て!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chamas nascidas do Force,
libertem-na do seu sono de gelo!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>fixed Razor remnant. -dragon</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3342</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000037</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>今だヨ、&lt;Veigue&gt;!!
氷を砕いて!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Agora, &lt;Veigue&gt;! Quebre o gelo!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3408</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000038</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うぉぉぉぉぉ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huaaah!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3618</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000039</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クレア!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Claire!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3683</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00003a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>キーッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Keee!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3704</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00003b</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……クレア!!
生きている……のか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Claire! Você está... viva?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3734</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00003c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Veigue&gt;……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...&lt;Veigue&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3789</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00003d</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クレア……！
どこも痛くないか？
気分は……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Claire! Está ferida?
Como você se sente?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3888</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00003e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん……私……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hum... Eu estou...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4016</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b00003f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クレア……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Claire...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4079</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000040</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……クレア……
震えているのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Claire... Você está tremendo?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4116</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000041</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……う、ううん。
違うの、&lt;Veigue&gt;……
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>N-Não... Estou bem, &lt;Veigue&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4138</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000042</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ここは少し寒いわ……
太陽にあたりたいな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Só está um pouco frio aqui...
Vou me aquecer no sol...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4219</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>0b000043</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クレア!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Claire!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
